        "fields": {
          "Pinout": "J1.1=PS1 DATA, J1.2=COMMAND, J1.3=~8V, J1.4=GND, J1.5=PS1 3.3V NC, J1.6=ATT, J1.7=CLOCK, J1.8=NC, J1.9=ACK",
          "Orientation": "3x3 pad topology is numbered row-major 1-2-3 / 4-5-6 / 7-8-9 as viewed at the PS1 male mating face; the plug solder/wire view is mirrored. Pad 1 is square. The 2.00 mm PCB pad pitch is for internal wires and is not the plug contact pitch.",
          "Assembly Note": "Use the Micha213 BlueRetro-compatible straight-pin Ali PS1/PS2 male plug rigidly captured by the Ali-case-derived enclosure. Very short individual conductors remain entirely inside the shell. Continuity-test every mating contact to the numbered PCB pad; never trust colors. Pins 5 and 8 remain open."
        }
      },
